# Generated book output. The builder lives in tools/ and is tracked; only what
# it produces is ignored.
#
# These rules previously named a `build/` directory, which the repository root
# .gitignore already excluded at every depth via an unanchored `build/` pattern.
# The result was that the original book pipeline was never committed at all --
# git had been silently ignoring the whole directory, including its source. The
# tooling now lives in `tools/` precisely so that cannot happen again.
tools/out/
